{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1333,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7ec4fb60c93b445599c7217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要眼神对上就要报以微笑☆……\r\n所以课上总是被点名吗？呜呜～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7643d133c4e94bbd69121db4542406f16f750ff9688940d29c0435939f6aff24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53e01d0b29393522957746a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂怒乐章送了我船桥的蔬菜……\r\n那张脸简直犯规！飞鹰子也被击中了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f24c075bacf975925f15de6c2b2f5cf388f18b6bd6edca2e92cb279962d26de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521616f7f4012534ecd4e918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想做美梦时请听飞鹰子的新曲♪\r\n一定能看到闪亮又令人兴奋的Live哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b47d52f2f9670a08270fe957ce1ccbbbffff7296bc286ed062f30b838e72ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959d3e5eac1c9c43a577b6ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起有三文钱拿，奇锐骏也这么说…\r\n夜里的特番我会录下来的！……大概！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1320bf5a6ed3fedd52e7a342affa13308495070ebd6db9b537876cc14b26b612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2248f1ec81e31614fbc65c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多辛苦、哪怕照不到阳光！\r\n我也会像蒲公英一样顽强又可爱地绽放☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e9827d07fe15fb01dc11d1b0809c11d5ced05d44b0f75056220646a455795f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443e56628e77983bbb5b2743",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对飞鹰子来说夏日漫步就是夏日祭吧☆\r\n光是看着各种演出就能获得元气呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "568495ebd8f4f09c7cd678ae699118c70672c22ebb3c6f6f0ddc07608c1f4030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc916645e98670993c1606fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃虫的鸣叫真好听～♪虽然只有秋天能听\r\n很寂寞……但就像限定Live一样，也不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f59d310f93d15d17f1ba151a26c620330f8a3c6c3ba3248e3ed8527554617d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c0c4b0be5b7b9162804f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬季Live把衣服和指挥棒做成发光的也行！\r\n就像是“我就是你的灯光秀”那样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15c277cf2e56e7f290af71ba93af9f5abe4258a855aaa4b70216e711f936e17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143cb87d4d953134c5306dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f354d5e6328e4329210f27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我的爸爸妈妈平时都很温柔，\n但吃饭时就会说『可不能剩饭哦』，\n一下子就变得严厉了～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8290c9cca04bcfbab1e4987997083f19fbf333e98c51382adc01601a98603ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f762348fffc8856ea37965b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候呢，晚上就特别想吃点心……\n不过闪耀同学总是会及时阻止我，\n所以也不必担心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c9ecb48a7225b8c120b5f723951a3bbd6868fae04ed39139233c5f1b23ab6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6350d79f4b439ccf294e1df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "卡莲酱的那种可爱，\n是属于魔性系的孩子呢……\n顺便一提，飞鹰子是清纯系哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "901f7045e299181765380724c8ce8c48fc12a7946cfb87d17c6d364cca94f6ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01b73d58e0eb40e924411b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子小时候总是搬家，\n所以没什么朋友呢……\n不过现在的话……哎嘿嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d246e4e65991018ac0aa06be7ccfc2724c7d831d1bc6800bfeed2220708df5b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f856db1b1ca18a0ea9c5e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍很热闹对吧～\n因为大家都热热闹闹地住在一起，\n所以完全不会觉得寂寞呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c597d84a6d99b2be5873c8eb881acdf43d5fafcf1eecd207478bce73966b2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e359b44c0e3b98beabd511",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿，好可爱啊～！\n感觉轻飘飘地，穿着也很舒服……\n和马娘的尾巴的相性也很好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "146ae62d45fffdf83cebb7bcb2f99d17adb4e288ecafecb60265189396b900fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a7621ed36ec28cb142b8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没法让大家的目光都集中在飞鹰子身上了……\n——什么的，骗你的哦！\n偶尔也想组成马娘偶像的团队呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a711f715dee008f1c25aad9ba0d15d68fb6d073b921edf2d05d77865d3047fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08bc7c9b6e400bde8c66cca8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这身衣服，\n大家都能明白飞鹰子就是马娘偶像的吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc9d1a35b1d71711aaed51b9ac4daf2957da07aea931c0bfee83ab4fee35aaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f276665af804c8cbc7b933f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服设计得很棒，\n而且这种粉色也很可爱吧～？\n这可是飞鹰子的印象色哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4fbb8797aeabe4bcd317d868b38d5cdad8341ff2c83ecb55756f99670719174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a11bcca9c341804a35c8661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常常会去河边做发声练习哦！\n清晨的空气真是让人舒爽呀～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3cbdcdc012abca80acf4da5dbd5b320a418ed1a1fb3c4138dd45cccdbecad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732f39a4f6f2aff89208ec2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到中午了呢～！因为浪费粮食是绝对NG的，\n所以在餐厅经常要思考点多少比较好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db9b10dcb69e69fce4589fb340000961857fd79af0fb2570f170903e01de516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641d568bb837453ed492e208",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想当偶像吗？我可不会输哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "941b6a61dc97f736e1e3381713e46b0ae164fc1e69757ec25382bec2e125e847",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf944ce88b33f00549f0a083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～哇☆\n为了明天也能展现精力十足的笑容，\n今天可得好好睡觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6542de2bb6455370247794a944602c1bbbdb376f816596f06234b1136cb6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2055fc83aa88e973ddd8fdd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花漫天飞舞呢～\n这种场景总觉得特别浪漫，\n飞鹰子很喜欢哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8e130c94b308487c8937e8d7faec26d0cd6f5c75639c23bfccea54d2e78b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fb20ad327fc210c0685e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑泳装也得慎重些。\n因为飞鹰子是清纯系偶像，\n所以大胆的衣服绝对NG哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58e71cfdbcda6ff22256ce53aa5ad4535d875e2a87d83331827c18b39032085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772d6e0591e2a166a27ba06e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当秋色环绕，寂寞便悄然袭来……\n啊！这句话感觉能写成歌词呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56df9f148e61c3567e992414b1dec9093d54d01adb4b42b461bc51951c5f00c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb77491aefc69849aa480f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷！！！\r\n想去温泉里舒舒服服泡个澡呀。\r\n毕竟泡温泉对皮肤也很好呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0956a086c43c7e88048c09d21fb78cfd3598edb1c435c5d46db7f95b6fa9386d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267c13ebda2805ef5a4582ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然小铃鹿一直很安静，\r\n但她内心深处也潜藏着马娘偶像的“热情”。\r\n……舞台也同样是战场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac09456dd659f22271e5314e7ba5362ae4a80b0c8b361b5994c391cadf1addde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6ef638d88fa186c9c264dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次小波旁拿话筒的时候，\r\n话筒里就会传出从没听过的杂音！\r\n居然会有这样的个性，好厉害……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f93f5a1a55be24d34fee38a8144b0800dffc49c723ee447a689fc19fe501fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26a0a6a08620dbdc6bf0fefb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔诶～！\r\n和致意小姐聊LIVE的对话没录下来～！\r\n明明是那么热血的八小时～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0980afbce3c597176ea9947ecf041ddb7953dfdd0e2fa16dd6836bfb160cf26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340b506c9aa1df1b1e8d58ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……帮帮我吧！\r\n麻烦你去找找小速子，告诉她\r\n『决胜服不许用蓄光材料制作』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fc079437915b68ed64d82fc552e149bdef4379eeb2401b9ab23685a403cefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11e54d10d6fb0b223090f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我请假去外地比赛的时候，班上的同学们都会帮我整理好课程重点……\r\n哎嘿嘿，飞鹰子真是身在福中呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1eb8cc78aa1da4ffd7c041f65bb342f2b18025bebe68c1c47d9f7b40e47a0d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f179feee080ad83c61d331c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也该早一点起床，\r\n去收拾一下高架桥下面的垃圾呢♪\r\n就当是表达平日里受它照顾的谢意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "156a80d250a92b258d243f69292f3759a1b94730c2c0cdbc9162e547ce593779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d308e20fd1583dcb12e45d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说听我说！原以为已经找不到了的教科书，\r\n没想到就落在床底下呢！……哎嘿嘿，\r\n飞鹰子一直很不擅长收拾房间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fb7b9d64272bc22da1473266d35054ccba9d696993b91779d09ec27a5a8c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a0db2f05aec47709defe6b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是夜晚也要时刻注意仪容仪表！\r\n对大家而言，飞鹰子可是24小时无休的马娘偶像！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b619fd826beb5875273f656d0958d0d66cce9806705a374f757c1bb6fafb93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6355def5c9107449643b3a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然眼下正是分别的季节，\r\n但今后也请继续做飞鹰子的粉丝哦！\r\n飞鹰子会继续让你神魂颠倒的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf6f31ea65a36f5da4f483779fcf6f685c1a5df6aa0c0e0304ba455731591dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9834c61ea680155fed8d2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，您最近被晒黑了吗？\r\n难、难道说是因为飞鹰子的光芒——\r\n……诶？因为我这件衣服反光？……呜～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad22c6ca01b2016c808cb491ef4713bdfb83a29f6ced5b3b56361a70b942e824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a3b289592f2494a3b68f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚爸爸给我发了LANE哦♪\r\n他说飞鹰子接下来要使用的跑道已经整备完成了！\r\n……感觉一下子打起精神来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "840f65c44bb79785883f9bd8af89a9a134c0981bdf8c3e8ccb3a60914234fcf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21194ffad94cf0e656a92857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒假的时候好像大家都会留在当地玩呢！\r\n我在本地没啥事儿……那就继续做那个吧！\r\n马娘偶像，全国巡演☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc8ed25a9937ad8291e361f21045a5bf58cd10e9f64e744df97fcc38968cb81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a58bc14b07cf62da4db65ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服是我意志的具现哦。\r\n为了成为顶尖马娘偶像，\r\n必须要胸怀比任何人都更耀眼的意志才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "788f1980b53b566d40c16018dde4f50c1806073b0741863e9f5d70765dec70df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d641a8c86ce18f9ade2d1b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次看见偶像时，她正独自在一片空地上跳舞。尽管如此，她和观众们的笑容都还是那么耀眼——就像这件衣服一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "118df5434898b2ba5d5d18acf13f480020d8d56c5e8b081579304d82b0a41d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357b2196c0fe42e0aa4bceba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逃马姐妹也变成5个人了……\r\n得成为可靠的领队才行！先从小事做起吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "997582429a00331f88e2e513b94eb2892790906d0b825f85886f5d4db5dc8669",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b979647ce36cc89f5ec0d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没人的街头Live也不寂寞♪小希偶尔\r\n会来偷偷放几颗糖果当慰问品呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd373e599bbef22bcf3ac4ccbc1b7b085a5773e60bfc42d6b70a87ee1a407b0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c34f131d7935d05d5b22be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能拿到海塞克桑的稀有CD……！\r\n情报贩子太强了……多亏了训练员啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b17a0418c626ded19303d77045a1ae8a62162a2c2b858cd922679b4c45a5c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8a3c8015d12a1ed8a33253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和历奇的『风水Live』大成功～！\r\n和奶奶们的Call&Response真新鲜啊☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2d2fa1f0ed071d94b96d5862f831401cdacf3f2c5c64c0aff927e7f6eec99d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c419c3939d471dc7ef31b05e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小景致的正统派气场真不是盖的。\r\n我身为正统派偶像也不能输呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42213d4b19c224a1b20e9ac74c923558ea8ce09ec65429f5ecc9a8aaf229bf3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f02338e87bce8f7d6bc6bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近飞鹰子很少赖床了吧♪\r\n如果需要叫醒服务，随时跟我说哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0ad76bef4502a96e6aba51b2d3c0bf515dc646413f907c56b901054436ba6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5a70e94ed06af7c8fffe85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有闪耀桑在卡路里管理很完美☆\r\n……虽然今天午饭分开了吃，有点可疑…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e19411526a88c117b68ff392bbd96a808a6a42f69d05f8cd78c95962d3217ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931aad96554c4257d5c27d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昏暗的路也会被我和哨子照亮♪\r\n闪、闪、闪、闪耀中☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "37957ea3624425cb358316319290f09ac431dc1fa814c26ef179adf4aea7b156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9260bd70fa74ba38600ad3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要写首关于春天的歌……想把成长的\r\n自豪和对后辈的声援都塞进去♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e2d30995d28daced02c1559261c111ac2b0834e1ab54c58041e464690585d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9404f1e7c2e9c62d9803f261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烟花下的舞蹈真好啊～。游乐园的夏夜\r\n巡游，好想和谁一起去看呀",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5da5e2c1d6caa65be7cc220cd4c7fe93b3004dd8ec69464d5123a6710b9bf46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dcc90c96e6bac2072bf735c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，一起去烤地瓜吧？\r\n就我们两个人的，秋季粉丝见面会♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa7c065f31795661beef1549c0bc3bceefe9958c6fe9852a7132c5fd10196f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a8f43e430d81ff456abab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铲雪时被夸奖了♪虽然是为了街头Live\r\n才铲的……但这可是秘密哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ff2c7d1677bdd1c9cd8818de215b6a16c1df1cfb6683cf4868736a73eeb5f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ffbcf290583efab23647b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在哪，只要展开斗篷就是闪亮舞台☆\r\n随时都能为大家送去梦想哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d864703c891196e9a8194060f4fc9b8a46942e1fc2cb2417148d0f2904b07a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0357cdf3f41e27fd0f9f55c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单马尾那么稀奇吗？还是制服太正式了？\r\n想看的话随你怎么……～呀！还是算了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c781d3cccb1cb6778035d93c3b08464ac237497b823f6656046145290ed4e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235b0b2a0f5eb242683fee10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得让大家也见识一下\n全力以赴的飞鹰子的可爱之处呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f441772db09abd6066db8885ddf3d21ab490e75c20d9beb5e85452abb80dc53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2617b8c2367a23c79fce1b17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa733ff789fff2bbbcd272796c5eaa908d68dcd4db3cf379167d971082b81281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb952f982cd590066e28dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对马娘偶像而言，\n泪水与汗水都是必经之事！\n所以，训练也要彻底全力以赴哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "02947c6f008abe229b07fe633edb36138ca9fa0a4f776d6acd0c9b9506d5d141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d65bc0f2da0b8b3bbc414b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候为自己加油打气也很重要呢\n预备——！\n飞鹰子、训练加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df0fe3e2a9eb424bf3d5916ac30cb244014640977cf9ed9ae70eedfb1ec0599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00391997009fc11b4bcfac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练？交给我吧！\n唱歌跳舞奔跑、\n样样精通才算是顶尖马娘偶像呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eebff17b77e31957868baac1c47f87d8424ce0b3780b564e829db3f2fa3050f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec9d0ca08ba25be774f45f77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一点都不讨厌训练哦☆\n只要想到比起昨天的自己又进步了\n一点，就会觉得非常开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9134a405c18f32033d325ff5a1029ca068fe9107f736147364643e834536dbeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df60504240e7b5025f0d7a13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要接受训练员的教导，\n就会打起十分的精神呢☆\n哎嘿嘿，要加油了哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "998c59b31c376e2a1969ed969e8de3e42b588dd1ac9ef502a62ee11d23496dc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752b6c0988cd606cde6feb2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论遇上什么困难，\n飞鹰子都不会放弃梦想哦！\n训练员，以后也请多指教了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce30d49bae4e92f53479504cbce5d96909d6218044a3ce72e3fed8064ff808ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358dfb9be843a63c6567089e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "付出无数无数努力，\n一切都是为了能够成为让大家展露笑容的\n顶尖马娘偶像哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4898e0281839cf2610b5fafeebd1bd97a8439f0b8def2bc86e14aab16c8b44db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6871db7ee6865f06c135ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挥洒汗水！讴歌眼泪！\r\n再将这一切都化作舞台上耀眼的光芒！\r\n飞鹰子总是全力以赴的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedc66d141425d5631fe1e1747db801a101993388ca5b4a6969fe76d45aa06f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8f52278afa9ad67c86f6b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在电视上见到的那些偶像，无论多么疲劳都还是满脸笑容！\r\n我也……我也想像他们那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c00c2a352cdb72b11cd40347beb92da4eb45788caa8897dc96204187a686964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208da2b025b8649bdb931118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是飞鹰子表现出不成熟的一面的话，\r\n一定要记得严厉地训斥我哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5e57f48c164b44c5251a32b8d19de349a869f55d8f45b23ca46deb2af54b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f180f4395026404de7cda3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仅仅会唱歌跳舞是行不通的，\r\n但只能在比赛中获胜也同样不行。\r\n身为马娘偶像就该文武双全！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88d33700e74a8113f0b73b23365b9fd680abe8b09d436f191e85c2ae13a290c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b77202546ae85e03f775fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多么激烈的舞蹈或者比赛，\r\n这条缎带都绝对不能乱掉♪\r\n毕竟这之中满怀着飞鹰子的梦想呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47a8b5656cb65e6d3c55adcbc170e20fc76b79dd41f5328200f95f348e8cb67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4346b4aee9dda4a8f332bbd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然通往顶尖马娘的道路困难重重……\r\n但是，我们互相扶持就没关系啦☆\r\n飞鹰子我们已经在熠熠生辉啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae448376293c8cbe65e7e2ff86c00a5630a2a42278766ed23f0ca46c3e7a9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b598a1ff2be0c613855c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孤身一人的话，梦想的永远都只能是梦想而已。\r\n是您让我能作为马娘偶像绽放光辉。\r\n谢谢您，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00138e5edad0079933f0dac9e6bd5c9204867af636c6e0b25991970de5b6f3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87a37b9367c5a3f35d536028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……现在的飞鹰子，是不是闪闪发光了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10130507c06515830fbd33957d45f306e3bd8691a4abf6ae8a8cde4f8cb62bd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:870d55dc45a1bcd0ac35fe40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离顶尖马娘偶像又近了一步呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "00690eb77e51f7dd59b9e22207976a0416195edacbadc932858058ef02547b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35feeab1ead0042ea9fea7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要流泪哦。我可是……马娘偶像啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fecc029d128d8aa2ae3a88e4488eb02805481c4141536e937de4751876e7d798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddeb0f313a5d40113c4770ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "除了『谢谢』以外，找不到别的话语呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0333e64650030226a59625d22b0c266ae2d4a419963f50bfc186841d21b6af4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58bb75557911e068f498d665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游行的终点，果然还是得Happy才行☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8a331575c89b8cf5a3a0b1770251bf89150deff18f5bc2221cb0182288da28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ad7b4fe3b07e998e5fa112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家玩得开心吗？这就是我的盛装游行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24abc6c06d71e2763ec67e115351083dd04ac5503d72b2f5ed53dfd6e3a3a8b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e46798bfc31453c61a9506",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘偶像～Power Up☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69a340d1c212b4f8cb07442c1cc3c2ee3bb2b29d0098dbb8dcd1737f74b4f59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1348aae86a846ed1cc659159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要更加更加闪亮哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622a95f6ecb4e73bc65d8de50f78094b3b0ac12e8450b8f7450948d504fbf58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1105d965e51ace517d87f97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子，要加油啦！☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "06cfdf2c9362848cef6f20b2d9c4986be5a02455ed57334cc380c8a4d02830d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f7748bb6ea9bdf60f44274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
